  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance the capacity of AU Member States to implement the global and continental Women Peace and Security (WPS) commitments with strong participation and leadership of African women including young women. Focused on the WPS-African Women&#x2019;s Leadership Network, key activities include capacity building, networking, dialogue, and outreach-related actions aimed to address the challenges to the implementation of the WPS agenda in Africa.</narrative>
